Examples::

.. tab:: Freeform

   .. code-block:: dakota

       method
         bayes_calibration
           wasabi
             pushforward_samples = 100
             data_distribution gaussian
               means = 0.0
               covariance diagonal values 1.0

.. tab:: JSON

   .. code-block:: json

       {
         "method": [
